      "widgets_values": [
        "## 3d/blockout-mesh\n\nStill pack plate -> untextured gray-box blockout for set dressing and framing.\n\nStructure and shape stages only: no upsample, no texture VAE, no PaintMesh. Shape sampling drops to 8 steps because a blockout is a proxy, not a deliverable.\n\nSource: `EZDCCLoadStillPack` (slug `go-see`, plate `mug`, layer `first`).\n\nUNET: `trellis_2_int8_convrot.safetensors`. CLIP vision: `dino_v3_vit_l.safetensors` (DINOv3 license, opt-in pack). Structure decode stays at 32.\n\nSaveGLB writes the mesh to `output/assets/objects/_lab-blockout/blockout_NNNNN_.glb` - MeshToFile3D only converts in memory. Do not mint an Asset Bible row from this graph.\n\nDINOv3 is Meta's custom commercial-friendly license - not Apache. MIT TRELLIS weights without DINOv3 cannot Queue.\n\nOccupancy: trellis - stop Blender desk, LTX, Wan, Klein denoise. One GB10 job.\n\nHandoff: 3d/trellis2. Load that graph next - the output is its input.\n"
      ],
      "title": "Operator note"
    },
