  "extra": {
    "lab_note": "## 3d/blockout-mesh\n\nStill pack plate -> untextured gray-box blockout for set dressing and framing.\n\nStructure and shape stages only: no upsample, no texture VAE, no PaintMesh. Shape sampling drops to 8 steps because a blockout is a proxy, not a deliverable.\n\nSource: `EZDCCLoadStillPack` (slug `go-see`, plate `mug`, layer `first`).\n\nUNET: `trellis_2_int8_convrot.safetensors`. CLIP vision: `dino_v3_vit_l.safetensors` (DINOv3 license, opt-in pack). Structure decode stays at 32.\n\nSaveGLB writes the mesh to `output/assets/objects/_lab-blockout/blockout_NNNNN_.glb` - MeshToFile3D only converts in memory. Do not mint an Asset Bible row from this graph.\n\nDINOv3 is Meta's custom commercial-friendly license - not Apache. MIT TRELLIS weights without DINOv3 cannot Queue.\n\nOccupancy: trellis - stop Blender desk, LTX, Wan, Klein denoise. One GB10 job.\n\nHandoff: 3d/trellis2. Load that graph next - the output is its input.\n",
    "lab_profile": "3d/blockout-mesh",
    "lab_description": "Still pack plate to untextured TRELLIS.2 blockout mesh. No texture pass.",
    "lab_trellis": {
      "unet": "trellis_2_int8_convrot.safetensors",
      "resolution": null,
      "stages": [
        "structure",
        "shape"
      ],
      "textured": false,
      "batch_size": 1,
      "save_prefix": "assets/objects/_lab-blockout/blockout",
      "native_only": true
    },
    "lab_app_mode": {
      "enabled": true,
      "default_view": "app",
      "frontend_min": "1.41.13",
      "lane": "3d",
      "occupancy": "trellis",
      "enhance_off_identity": true,
      "handoff": [
        "3d/trellis2"
      ]
    },
